wgf-autopilot 1
# The whole race on physics, three laps, recorded by `wgf autopilot --record`
# (tools/drive.py typing into the record build's window: RACER_LAPS=3), then the
# results and Race again by Enter. Long: in a browser it needs `--timeout` past its
# default (a headless browser here draws about 30 frames a second).
